smartd: setgroups() with the LikeOS C library declaration.

popen_as_ugid() (smartd's -u option for warning scripts) calls
setgroups(1, &gid).  The LikeOS C library declares the list as int rather
than gid_t; both are 32 bits.  A C++ overload taking gid_t forwards to it,
so the upstream call stays as it is.

